\] Now, take half of \(\frac{9}{2}\): \[
\frac{9}{2} \times \frac{1}{2} = \frac{9 \times 1}{2 \times 2} = \frac{9}{4}
\] Finally, convert the improper fraction \(\frac{9}{4}\) back to a mixed number: \[
